<title>UK: OPEC basket price $23.21 on Friday.</title>
<headline>OPEC basket price $23.21 on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of OPEC's basket of seven crudes was $23.21 per barrel on Friday against $22.97 on Thursday, the OPECNA news agency said, quoting the OPEC secretariat.</p>
<p>The basket comprises Algeria's Saharan Blend, Indonesia's Minas, Nigeria's Bonny Light, Saudi Arabia's Arabian Light, Dubai of the UAE, Venezuela's Tia Juana and Mexico's Isthmus.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7630</p>
